            "kira_final": "The SPARQL query has been created and saved to `/app/solution.sparql`. The query retrieves all full professors who:\n1. Have a role containing \"Professor\" but not \"Assistant Professor\"\n2. Work in at least one department of a university located in an EU country (using the 27 EU member states as of 2025-08-16)\n3. Have at least one department they work in with more than 10 currently enrolled students (enrolled on or before 2025-08-16 and not graduated by that date)\n\nThe query returns the professor's name and a concatenated list of all countries where they currently work.",
